{"id":"9ab7d3064766870c","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-ax-hilbert-neg.md","title":"Hilbert Axiom Schema 3 (Negation)","display":"ax-hilbert-neg — Hilbert Axiom Schema 3 (Negation)","type":"axiom","metadata":{"type":"axiom","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-ax-hilbert-neg","aliases":["58-ax-hilbert-neg"],"display":"ax-hilbert-neg — Hilbert Axiom Schema 3 (Negation)","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-negation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"axiom"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-ax-hilbert-neg"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-ax-hilbert-neg</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ax-hilbert-neg — Hilbert Axiom Schema 3 (Negation)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b12f7bba0caac2c7\" href=\"?note=b12f7bba0caac2c7\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-negation.md\">../batch11/58-df-negation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,\\Sigma\\in V\">\\(S,\\Sigma\\in V\\)</span> (formal-language signature and symbol alphabet)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\subseteq V\\)</span> (formula set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\">\\(\\neg\\)</span> (negation connective, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b12f7bba0caac2c7\" href=\"?note=b12f7bba0caac2c7\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-negation.md\">../batch11/58-df-negation.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}hilbert\\text{-}neg} \\vdash \\forall \\varphi, \\psi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;((\\neg\\varphi \\to \\neg\\psi) \\to (\\psi \\to \\varphi))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}hilbert\\text{-}neg} \\vdash \\forall \\varphi, \\psi \\in \\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;((\\neg\\varphi \\to \\neg\\psi) \\to (\\psi \\to \\varphi))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>该公理表达<strong>逆否原理</strong>（proof by contrapositive）</li>\n<li>若从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\varphi\">\\(\\neg\\varphi\\)</span> 可推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\psi\">\\(\\neg\\psi\\)</span>，则从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span> 可推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span></li>\n<li>这是 Hilbert 系统中处理否定词的核心公理，使逆否推理成为内嵌规则</li>\n<li>该公理加上前两条蕴含公理和肯定前件规则，构成<strong>完备的命题逻辑公理系统</strong></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-negation.md","status":"resolved","id":"b12f7bba0caac2c7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-negation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","exce